VersionView.description:
Upload response (contracts C-10): `201 {"version":N,"source_digest":"sha256:…","build_state":"pending"}`;
eager compile → `202` with the same shape and `build_state:"building"`. Also the shape of
`GET …/versions/{v}` (plus `lock_digest`, `failure`, `created_at`).

failure.description:
`{code, reason, message, diagnostics}` when `failed`. `code` is stable: a build's reason, or
for `from-url` `fetch_failed`, `egress_denied`, `egress_quota`, `too_large`,
`validation_failed`, `invalid_artifact`.
